msgid "Robot launch name in that README is `panthera_ht`."
msgstr "该 README 中的机器人 launch 名是 `panthera_ht`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:18
#: 98ce3d4ed04a4ef6b878069d5a7a0d71
