msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:20
#: efb4d26e613e4c6994845f3197407711
msgid "Field zip"
msgstr "现场 zip"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:22
#: 50b3afc82f00404f97c2ed5c5dda0f29
msgid "README “quick deployment”: unzip (example `~/ht-deploy-ws`), then:"
msgstr "README「快速部署」：解压（示例 `~/ht-deploy-ws`），然后："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:24
#: faf1ab60c458429ca7f0ecaa9cf623c0
msgid ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./release.sh --install\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./release.sh --install\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:31
#: 1b484f60350d436c90ec622809808873
msgid "Git clone (development)"
msgstr "Git 克隆（开发）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:33
#: 5588f97c37f141b18b09cd3ee3d981f4
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b panthera-ht git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"ht-deploy-ws\n"
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b panthera-ht git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"ht-deploy-ws\n"
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:40
#: 98bce990531f4775a65c4f4beb558a5a
msgid "Then `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` and `./quick_start.sh` to build."
msgstr "然后 `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` 并运行 `./quick_start.sh` 进行编译。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:42
#: ec7cb89c40844cf982ce91aad55cbadb
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:44
#: 4ed4ef5b34864c4f9389d91961bf9ef9
msgid ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:49
#: 0819d70504344c5fa6b659e1d148c630
msgid ""
"README: **Build** (simulation vs real-hardware packages), then **Launch**"
" (single / dual arm, simulation or real). Real hardware uses serial "
"(`/dev/ttyACM*`); the script prompts for permissions."
msgstr ""
"README：**编译**（仿真 vs 真机软件包），然后 **启动**（单臂 / "
"双臂，仿真或真机）。真机使用串口（`/dev/ttyACM*`）；脚本会提示权限。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:51
#: c2834171ab3444578c143ab90a24405f
msgid ""
"Isomorphic teleop (同构遥操作) on this branch is `./teleop_start.sh` (master /"
" slave). See [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](../../5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md) and the same README"
" section on `teleop_start.sh`. Drag teaching (拖动遥操作) is **not** a "
"separate implemented stack."
msgstr ""
"该分支上的同构遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh`（主 / 从）。见 [同构遥操作](../../5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md) 以及同一 README 中关于 `teleop_start.sh` 的章节。拖动示教（拖动遥操作）**不是** 另一套已实现的栈。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:53
#: 0f19e1e95e984c138520e26825db0e78
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:55
#: 9a296fa5b828404fbf14ebb492f2613f
msgid "Prefer the script. README equivalents:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。README 等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:57
#: c02f216190a74da4b1454b336386c333
msgid ""
"source ~/ht-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=single hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual hardware:=real"
msgstr ""
"source ~/ht-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=single hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht "
"type:=dual hardware:=real"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:65
#: 455dbb7073804a66bde119018370574e
msgid ""
"README `type:=dual` / `type:=single` is **arm topology**, not an end-"
"effector key, and does **not** expand to `left_type` / `right_type`. "
"Different L/R EEF keys use `left_type:=` / `right_type:=` (do not also "
"pass `type:=`) — "
"[robot_common_launch](../../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"README 里的 `type:=dual` / `type:=single` 是**臂拓扑**，不是末端键，也**不会**展开成 `left_type` / `right_type`。左右不同末端用 `left_type:=` / `right_type:=`（不要同时再传 `type:=`）— [robot_common_launch](../../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md:67
#: f6fbd7d433b34cf4b37aeacc27e854ab
msgid ""
"Zenoh: same as other deploy hosts — `ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` (README)."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：与其他部署主机相同 — `ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 和 "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`（README）。"

